$, where $D$ is the determinant of the coefficient matrix and ${D}_{y}=$" :question/worked-solution "We are given the system\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}5x+(-3)y+1z=1 \\\\ 4x+0y+(-1)z=-3 \\\\ 1x+(-1)y+1z=-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe determinant of the coefficient matrix is\n\n$$\nD=|\\begin{aligned}5 & -3 & 1 \\\\ 4 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 1\\end{aligned}|.\n$$\n\nNow, to construct ${D}_{y}$, we replace the second column of the coefficient matrix by the right-hand side column of the given system:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{D}_{y}=|\\begin{aligned}5 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 4 & -3 & -1 \\\\ 1 & -3 & 1\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-42693/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b9c2dc67-95ca-52f2-a292-32891000b76a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-42693"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} [:db/retract 17592186120370 :question/answer-fields 17592186118695] {:db/id "q-42681/selection/ma-v1/7a565013f64f800de4ebb7d98243ce73ba567d5ffbbb4dedf1fb1eea5c00b1c0/e377cc1a18796007f622b7c9b138acf2e03e45af50a6a08db0bc34a009f4b58a" :answer/id #uuid "a7c36170-24e6-5930-90ce-9eaa76959fed" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}-3 & -9 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1 & -4 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 0\\end{aligned}|" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42681/selection/ma-v1/7a565013f64f800de4ebb7d98243ce73ba567d5ffbbb4dedf1fb1eea5c00b1c0/dec5241035420e0f27e13e43c5b74bef073599537e0fb48d8603178b6de04f30" :answer/id #uuid "44c65132-bfe3-5b21-802c-0cba380c57c1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}-3 & 5 & -9 \\\\ 1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ -2 & 8 & 3\\end{aligned}|" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42681/selection/ma-v1/7a565013f64f800de4ebb7d98243ce73ba567d5ffbbb4dedf1fb1eea5c00b1c0/77b79b4964285c96465dde702526973168e482967e4357fc83be91d30e22a957" :answer/id #uuid "a10f0be3-70e7-575a-abc6-284fc02f08b4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "|\\begin{aligne